{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24065","headline":"新秋喜凉因寄兵部杨侍郎 · 白居易","name":"新秋喜凉因寄兵部杨侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"外强火未退，中锐金方战。\n一夕风雨来，炎凉随数变。\n徐徐炎景度，稍稍凉飙扇。\n枕簟忽凄清，巾裳亦轻健。\n老夫纳秋候，心体殊安便。\n睡足一屈伸，搔首摩挲面。\n褰帘对池竹，幽寂如僧院。\n俯观游鱼羣，仰数浮云片。\n闲忙各有趣，彼此宁相见。\n昨日闻慕巢，召对延英殿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}